WEBVTT

00:00:01.970 --> 00:00:04.270
Please have some.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.770
Thank you very much.

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:07.520
Thank you very much.

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:09.440
Something's moving!

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.490
Gaku Un, something's coming near.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:17.620
I can feel the stir in my Cloud Strings.

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:23.050
But it's weak, I don't think it's something big.

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:26.380
Still we should take care, nothing is too small.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Newbies, you're exposing yourselves
by drawing your swords too early.</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.090
No need to panic, let me protect you guys.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:50.430
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:12.040
Reikenzan: Hoshikuzu-tachi no Utage

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:20.560
We drew a scribbled map of the future with no defined end

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:27.260
But you smiled saying, "no matter how lost we get,

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:30.780
or how much we cry, the end will come"

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:37.940
If tomorrow was an untouched white canvas

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:43.650
I'd like to see what kind of colors would shine the brightest

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:48.000
Like tears leaving behind a rainbow

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:53.940
I'll prove to you I can change this world

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:58.270
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:01.310
Listening to the footsteps of a tomorrow

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:05.490
whose name we've yet to know

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:22.620
So you're my prey.

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:27.290
Watch and learn the power
of Rei-san's Cloud Sword skills!

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:37.170
Lunar fox, tier 4 level 1:

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:40.360
Passive and likes playing with humans.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:43.350
When feeling particularly playful,
eyes will turn red and teeth will be exposed.

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:45.310
Commonly used as a pet.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.020
I think that's enough.

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:50.340
You're the one that says there's
nothing too small to face in a trial.

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:51.900
Well...

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:56.420
It may be trying to deceive us by looking cute.

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:58.150
Don't be fooled.

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:01.700
Now that the danger is gone,
let's get back to our break.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:06.740
I feel like creating another recipe, but will I succeed?

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:23.800
These students, who are fairly
new cultivators at the Ki Stage,

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:28.140
have figured out how to tap into their potential
strength after only one day of training,

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:35.830
<i>Gaku Keiyo learned to use the March Technique,
and that in turn helped her classmate, Bunin.</i>

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:40.150
<i>Fatty has become more agile. </i>

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:43.660
<i>While Shushin has better control of his strength now.</i>

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:51.400
<i>Probably from his motivation to better Oriku,
Ochu unexpectedly improved as well.</i>

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:55.750
<i>Unfortunately, these three are still struggling.</i>

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:55.790
Unfortunately, these three are still struggling.

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:55.840
Unfortunately, these three are still struggling.

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:55.880
Unfortunately, these three are still struggling.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:55.920
Unfortunately, these three are still struggling.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:55.960
Unfortunately, these three are still struggling.

00:03:56.580 --> 00:04:00.260
<i>It's no wonder Elder Kaun had
to put in the extra effort to help them.</i>

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:02.930
<i>And Oriku? He's no longer beside me.</i>

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:05.390
<i>What's with all that sweat?</i>

00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:07.560
Hold on a second, everybody.

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:20.230
<i>Even such great potential, he's still at the Body Stage.</i>

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:25.360
<i>He can't compare with the others who
are already using various techniques.</i>

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:29.990
<i>Technically, he's not my responsibility.</i>

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:35.370
<i>But I can't bring myself to just leave him like that.</i>

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:40.630
<i>But as a legacy disciple, he needs
to realize he can't be all talk. </i>

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:43.340
<i>If he continues like this...</i>

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:49.020
Gaku-chan, I don't think I can keep up anymore.

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:52.770
But a thought came to my mind,

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:56.410
"clumsy birds have to start flying early".

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:01.110
So I'll go on ahead while you guys rest.

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:03.240
Then we can rendezvous at Azure Dragon Gorge.

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:05.700
There's no way that's happening.

00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:10.330
It'll be fine! I already studied
Bunin's monster guidebook.

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:12.280
This is no joke!

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:15.250
"Knowledge is power" doesn't apply here.

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:19.470
We've already reached Full Moon Valley.

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:24.010
I had to rely on Kaku Ei's help just to cover you guys.

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:27.930
Going on ahead alone, is a death wish.

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:33.850
Fear not!

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:36.830
Ochu-sama.

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:39.730
Something's approaching, Gaku Un!

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:43.320
Demon ape!

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:45.610
Leave them to me.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:59.580
Come on now, Ochu-sama's waiting for you!

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:05.650
Stone Tree Ape!?

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:08.090
Where did the others go?

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:10.510
Don't just stand there!

00:06:16.010 --> 00:06:17.200
We're surrounded!

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:20.740
My Cloud Strings can't handle monsters this big.

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:21.360
Gaku Un!

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:23.070
The trial is now over!

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:24.360
I'll hold them off.

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.290
Kaku Ei, cover everyone and run!

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:31.120
If you can make it out of Full Moon Valley,
the Spell of Decree should fend them off from there!

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:40.780
We've gotta get out of Full Moon Valley
while Gaku Un holds them off.

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:43.130
Everyone, start using the March Technique!

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:48.220
This is...a lunar howl!?

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:54.350
What should I do...Can I protect everyone
while facing such a high-level monster?

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.770
Hey you!

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:59.400
How can you call yourself
"lunar howl" when you're this big?

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:05.400
Your name is too similar to the lunar fox,
change your name this instant.

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:08.240
Back off, Oriku!

00:07:10.010 --> 00:07:11.840
There's no time.

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:13.910
Everyone, get behind me!

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:21.290
This howl is one of its biggest moves.
I can actually feel my soul tremble.

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:26.670
Although I'm at the Ki Stage, I can barely stand.
And this is with the aid of spells.

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:30.590
Can't imagine taking it at a closer range.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:32.590
Oriku...

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:35.350
How on earth is he still standing!?

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:39.520
How long are you gonna scream?!
It's not mating season yet.

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:41.850
Stop, or I'll cut you down.

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:50.280
Shut up already! You ugly monster.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:53.910
Don't make me cut off your front tail!

00:07:56.310 --> 00:07:57.160
I win!

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:02.380
Even after taking the full brunt of that howl,
he still managed to defeat the monster?

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:06.960
Wait, but why didn't he take any damage?
Is he really only at tier 2 of the Body Stage?

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:09.630
Gaku Un, are you okay?

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:11.380
Why are you guys still here?

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:13.800
Hurry up and get out of Full Moon Valley!

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:15.760
Gaku Un!

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:20.120
You're so ugly you made my team-mate puke.

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:22.020
Apologize to him by taking out these monsters.

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:30.530
Are we there yet? Are we there yet?

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:36.820
It's my first time experiencing
the howl of this monster.

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:42.040
I wouldn't have made it without the protection
of spells, but how did Oriku?

00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:46.970
Maybe that stingy elder
gave him some divine armor?

00:08:46.970 --> 00:08:50.750
No, I think it's the difference in body strength.

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:52.050
Body strength?

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:56.050
It's not like Oriku has some
special trick that we don't have.

00:08:56.620 --> 00:09:00.840
He's just far more stronger on the physical side.

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:05.060
The lunar howl's attack is of the physical kind,

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:09.060
so it can be blocked by sheer physical strength.

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.040
Which is essentially what our spells replicate.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:16.070
Gaku Un, your wound is too deep,

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:20.080
we've gotta stop the trial and ask for help.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:22.750
Yeah, I think you're right.

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:27.790
Now's not the time to worry about
losing points because we called for help.

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:29.790
Hold on a second,

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:32.550
can this summoning charm call any elder?

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:41.890
Here she comes.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:46.680
Hi Riku-chan, long time no see.

00:09:46.680 --> 00:09:49.900
Were you feeling lonely without me around?

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:53.240
Elder Obu, it's an honor to see you.

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:56.900
There's no need for formalities.

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:04.410
I'm impressed that you guys managed to defeat
this many monsters, with only one casualty.

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:08.390
It's all thanks to your legacy disciple Oriku.

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:12.920
You entered the sect a few
years ago, Gaku Un, right?

00:10:13.260 --> 00:10:16.420
Elder Ryuken speaks highly of you.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:22.760
It was very brave of you to potentially sacrifice
yourself to cover your team's retreat.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:24.890
Exactly what I expect to see from a team leader.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:31.860
I seldom meet her because of her
sour relationship with Elder Ryuken.

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:35.980
I assumed she'd be much more strict with me,
I never expected to receive such praise.

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:39.620
Still, that was an unnecessary move.

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:41.870
Why didn't you fight together?

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:46.150
A trial is not just a game.

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:49.540
You'll only truly grow by fighting till your last breath.

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:58.550
When I was taking the trial at your age,
only ten or so of us survived, out of hundreds...

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:58.550
It feels so weird to see her give a serious lecture.

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:01.550
One stick for everyone.

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:05.060
The destination is already set for Tetrad Peak.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:07.100
Not Ethereal Peak?

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:09.230
To buy some time...

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:12.230
Elder Obu, are you staying here?

00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:17.130
This many monsters in Full Moon Valley can only mean

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:21.780
there's something wrong with the Spell of Decree.

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:27.990
I'll take Oriku and investigate,
to avoid future accidents.

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:30.920
I see, thanks for your help.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.130
He really believed me!

00:11:36.560 --> 00:11:42.340
It doesn't feel right, telling a lie
to an honest guy like Gaku Un.

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:45.420
We should come up with
an excuse when we get back.

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:47.770
I'll just pretend like I didn't know.

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:49.520
All right, let's go.

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:53.400
I'll say I was forced by my teacher.

00:11:55.830 --> 00:12:00.900
It's time to plunder! The master of
the Jindan Stage is here, outta my way!

00:12:01.230 --> 00:12:06.660
Thousand year old lingzhi mushrooms,
hundred year old divine grass, you're all mine!

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:13.780
What a rich harvest! This is such a rare chance.

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:17.350
If I don't take it all now, someone else might.

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:21.050
What a scumbag.

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:23.660
What!?

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:32.880
To the chief and all elders, I committed a great sin.
After a whole night of repentance,

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:37.560
I realized the gravity of my sin, and decided
I can only atone by helping those in need.

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:46.130
I will be traveling the Nine Regions.
Please don't search for me.

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:57.630
Unbelievable. First the flop at the Celestial
Gathering, and now another mess!

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:02.210
Isn't it just preposterous that
an elder of the Heavenly Sword Hall,

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:06.900
actually stole divine materials and ran away?

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:12.770
Our seventh elder entrusted me with Azure Cloud Peak before departing for his travels,

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:23.080
but at the end of it all, it was my own disciple's
summoning charm that brought her in.

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:27.180
How am I going to face him now?

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:30.620
What should I do?

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:34.660
What's done is done.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:37.630
We can only be honest about what happened.

00:13:38.220 --> 00:13:40.130
Sounds like it was tough.

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:44.470
But thanks to Oriku, we were
able to come back in one piece.

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:47.300
Hey, be careful.

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:50.040
You'll stain your precious sword.

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:55.320
Well to be honest, I'm still pretty bad.

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:57.960
Sword arts is definitely something
you've gotta practice everyday.

00:13:57.960 --> 00:14:00.210
Yeah, you're right.

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:04.210
I'll clean it for you. It hurts
my eyes just to see it stained.

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:12.870
Please don't blame Elder Obu,

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:19.530
she's part of our own sect.
I'm sure she had good reasons for it.

00:14:19.530 --> 00:14:22.580
In fact, I don't mind at all.

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:25.880
The seventh elder is too lenient.

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:31.390
Well, I guess it wasn't such a big deal to begin with.

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:46.540
The lunar howl's attack is of the physical kind,
so it can be blocked through sheer physical strength.

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:48.780
Which is essentially what our spells replicate.

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:56.630
After leaving a letter of apology,
Obu really did disappear from the Reiken Sect.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:00.630
Although she said she'd atone
by traveling and helping others,

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:05.500
Oriku knew she was probably just refining
the materials and making a fortune off of them.

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:10.510
Before leaving the mountain, Obu left Oriku
an Amorphic Bones strengthening pill,

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:13.590
along with a detailed guide on
how to advance to the next level.

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:22.020
These two would serve him well
during the period of her absence.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.710
Is he out?

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:41.010
At this time? He must still be asleep.

00:15:41.010 --> 00:15:42.790
I'm awake.

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:45.420
What are you guys doing here
this early in the morning?

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:50.590
At least put some clothes on when you're in
the presence of girls, do you have no sense of shame!?

00:15:50.910 --> 00:15:51.590
Nope.

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:55.230
Sorry to bother you this early.

00:15:55.230 --> 00:16:00.810
I hope you guys didn't climb all the way
up here just to say "good morning."

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:06.730
We've come to say our thanks.

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:10.740
I came with everyone as soon as possible,
after being bedridden for several days.

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:13.240
Thanks very much for your help during the trial.

00:16:13.640 --> 00:16:17.370
Alright, you're welcome.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:20.870
If you brought some gifts just put them there.

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:22.410
Well then, bye-bye.

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:28.650
What's with that attitude,
we're here to sincerely to say our thanks.

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:31.630
I've never seen a legacy disciple so arrogant.

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:37.600
I just wanted to get back to my
medicine bath before it gets cold.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:41.060
Well then, please accept our thanks.

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:45.310
Fatty Mcfatt!?

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:49.280
Um, could I talk to you for a sec.

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:51.440
What, say it.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:54.200
C-Could you together with me...

00:16:57.200 --> 00:17:00.580
How horrible, you just want my body?

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:04.830
N-No, I wanted to ask you to help me with sword arts!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:05.950
Huh?

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:07.780
Why me?

00:17:07.850 --> 00:17:10.340
You don't like how Elder Ryuken teaches?

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:14.690
Elders seldom teach us one-on-one.

00:17:14.690 --> 00:17:18.780
We get other teachers who regularly guide us,

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:22.890
but I often find it hard to grasp
what they're trying to say.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:27.880
If an actual teacher can't teach you, how can
someone like me, who's only at the Body Stage?

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:28.980
You don't get it.

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:32.530
Despite being at the Body you
were able to defeat a lunar howl.

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:36.490
Physical strength is what matters,
not the stage you're at.

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:39.480
You know what you're talking about, Fatty McFatt.

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:42.530
I can teach you, but on one condition.

00:17:42.530 --> 00:17:45.620
Really? I'll do anything.

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:48.590
Treat me like your teacher.

00:17:48.590 --> 00:17:53.010
And I don't mean the formalities,
but rather, obeying whatever I say.

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:54.170
No problem.

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:58.970
All right, let's meet at the arena
behind Cloud Crossing hall.

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:06.010
That's enough.

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:09.520
You're just wasting time now.

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:13.050
But I was told to keep practicing...

00:18:13.050 --> 00:18:16.550
Didn't you agree to listen to whatever I say?

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:18.200
Oh yeah...

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:21.660
Try me one-on-one, let's see what you can do.

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:24.660
Go easy on me.

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:34.880
You know why you lost?

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:41.090
Your sword skill set was superior than mine?

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:42.730
Superior?

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:45.140
This is just a skill set used by normal people.

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:50.590
Yours is the DarkSteel Sword Skill Set,
one of the well-known ones from the Reiken Sect.

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:52.770
Clearly mine is far more inferior.

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:58.700
But you have better body building,
so even with normal martial arts...

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:04.300
You mean my body at the tier 2 Body Stage
is stronger than yours at the 9th tier Ki Stage?

00:19:04.300 --> 00:19:09.720
No, together with the DarkSteel Skill Set,
you're at an advantage in every way. So why?

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:13.710
I don't know, why?

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:17.510
It's simply because you're a pile of pure garbage.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:28.530
The elders must have gone mad admitting
a damn fatty like you as inner-court disciple.

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:34.140
In other words, you're a shame
to the whole sect, Fatty Mcfatt.

00:19:34.140 --> 00:19:36.110
I-I...

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:41.080
How is it possible for someone to even give birth to trash like you?

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:46.310
Your father is the teacher for the future
emperor of the Soran country, you say?

00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:49.580
What type of loser raises
their child to become like this?

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:52.460
Don't insult my father!

00:19:58.310 --> 00:20:03.750
How was it so powerful?
Wait, so you intentionally...

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:05.470
But why?

00:20:05.940 --> 00:20:07.730
Why?

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:12.320
That's what I want to ask.

00:20:13.070 --> 00:20:16.570
Why after two years of training,
you still don't realize,

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:22.320
a warrior needs a certain something called rage.

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:24.570
Rage?

00:20:24.940 --> 00:20:29.460
<i>My right hand went numb after
taking the force of that hit.</i>

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:34.580
<i>But the feeling dispensed into the body,
and disappeared after taking a breath.</i>

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:37.840
<i>This must be the power of Amorphic Bones.</i>

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:44.020
According to the guide left by Obu,
the 8th tier of Amorphic Bones requires

00:20:44.020 --> 00:20:55.960
a heavy hit that can be lethal to almost every bone
in the body, in order to breakthrough to the next tier.

00:20:57.580 --> 00:21:02.740
That hit from Fatty—I mean
Fatty Mcfatt, was perfect for that.

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:07.780
So that's how the DarkSteel Sword Set is supposed to be?

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:12.980
Yes indeed. The Reiken Sect named itself after
the sword, so of course a sword set is their forte.

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:16.670
But I don't think I can do it again.

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:19.280
Your rage is depleted huh?

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:22.120
Emotions are a source of power,

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:24.810
thus cultivation is also of one's heart.

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:31.060
One can control their emotions at will,
and learn to use it as an edge in a fight.

00:21:31.400 --> 00:21:36.770
Wow, you're really learned.
You know so many things!

00:21:37.180 --> 00:21:41.620
Didn't you also learn about
the Ethereal Heart at Ethereal Peak?

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:43.190
Pay attention in class!

00:21:43.510 --> 00:21:45.110
Well then, let's try again.

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:50.700
Now that I know you're intentionally
doing it, I won't get angry.

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:52.700
Don't worry, that won't be a problem.

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:56.960
There's a really easy way to force it,
unless you're a masochist.

00:21:57.280 --> 00:21:57.960
What?

00:21:57.960 --> 00:21:58.460
Punch!

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:23.740
The beat that quivers
within my worn down memory,

00:22:24.170 --> 00:22:27.210
Drowns in my slumber,

00:22:27.380 --> 00:22:29.050
sinking below the surface

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:35.070
My eyes, as they
look up to a pouring sky

00:22:35.460 --> 00:22:40.470
Reflect a heart locked
away by the moonlight

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:51.320
Only my most twisted pain
lies within this weaving infinity

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:57.760
Bleeding away miserably
as our intertwined fingers untangle

00:22:58.100 --> 00:23:01.490
Clinging to your feelings,

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:04.690
oh so powerfully

00:23:05.080 --> 00:23:10.250
I'll show you I can go
beyond this rusted world

00:23:10.780 --> 00:23:15.840
The words that pierced
through this permanent illusion

00:23:16.100 --> 00:23:25.940
Resound through my out stretched fingers

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:37.570
"A Flash of Amorphic Bones".

00:23:37.570 --> 00:23:39.350
Waiting for you at the Reiken Mountain.
